                      'None.\n'
                      '\n'
                      '## Events\n'
                      '\n'
                      '- **output**: Emits the built object\n'
                      '  - `adData` (Any): Object containing whichever of these keys are present: '
                      '`gclid`, `wbraid`, `gbraid`, `fbc`, `fbp`. Empty object `{}` if none are '
                      'detected.\n'
                      '\n'
                      '## Sources, in order\n'
                      '\n'
                      'For each click identifier (`gclid`, `wbraid`, `gbraid`, `fbclid`):\n'
                      '1. Look in the current URL query string. If found, write to a first-party '
                      'cookie (`lz_<name>`, max-age 1 year) so the value survives navigation to a '
                      'separate form page.\n'
                      '2. Else, read from the `lz_<name>` first-party cookie.\n'
