                      '- **Data Grid Focus**: Scroll to a specific data grid after filtering or '
                      'searching\n'
                      '- **Element Navigation**: Jump to any element by its ID\n'
                      '- **Form Sections**: Scroll to a specific section of a form\n'
                      '- **Error Highlighting**: Scroll to a component that has validation errors',
